{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1312.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"930ab106cec57a5eb710bf2981639c5390eb23e85dc1d112cfa1e03e81140b6d","ja":"姉の大変さ","zh":"当姐姐的辛苦","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1312.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"fac4db7367ea056061712b4a5e56b33e339d2d6aa9367b41dbe8575863457752","ja":"貴音ちゃんばっかり、瑞希お姉ちゃんに\nお願いを聞いてもらえてずるい！","zh":"每次都只有小贵音能让瑞希姐姐\n听你的请求，太狡猾了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1312.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"108be0c3fc9bdbd0435b9cb8d3d0e9b37570f5a417f8a6ff79cd19347d98e771","ja":"そんな……このみこそ、瑞希お姉様にいろんなことを\nしてもらっているではないですか。","zh":"没那回事……明明是瑞希姐姐为木实\n做了很多事情不是吗。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1312.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"8ae33beb341129ae87f6f766a57adee0394fe448f40ae76795d4684854171754","ja":"ふ、ふたりとも、飲み物を買ってきますので、\nその間に仲直りしてください……プリーズ。","zh":"两、两位，我去买些喝的回来，\n请趁这段时间好好和好吧……拜托了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1312.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"9a29b82df6faac4e0cf0ce5efa3ae0248d888b617eb625da2e447b6193a3cd2b","ja":"貴音ちゃん、すごくいい調子よ！　瑞希ちゃんも\n急な妹たちのケンカにどぎまぎしてたわ。","zh":"贵音的状态非常好哦！瑞希也因为\n妹妹们突然吵架而不知所措呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1312.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"c64e731b79115f780342f4c1535aedbd38885ba4e0e896454357a2fb74f3bfbf","ja":"このみに合わせてみたのですが、\nこれでよかったのですね。安心いたしました。","zh":"是按照喜好搭配的，\n这样合适就好。我放心了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1312.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"bbca123db45486d5a538fa4a89d709a0816562988ed10d7862dd8d59c9089f4c","ja":"ね、ねえ、今日、瑞希さんたち、\n朝からずっと変じゃない？","zh":"那个、我说，今天瑞希她们，\n是不是从早上起就很奇怪啊？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1312.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"ccd10dc580a8fbb6bb918fce4930fda54ca84337140fe846f83c2ccdc966f570","ja":"うふふ、実はね……今日1日、私たちは瑞希ちゃんの\n妹になったの。瑞希ちゃんのお姉さん体験のためにね！","zh":"呵呵呵，其实呢……今天1天，我们成了瑞希的\n妹妹。是为了让瑞希体验当姐姐的感觉哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1312.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"b1f0d194ea6c9d70b6dd3f737a1b3a4b118f3db3194b33d43a97af509473a400","ja":"このみさんと貴音さんのほうが年上なのに！？\nなんだか不思議だけど……でも楽しそうかも！","zh":"明明是木美和贵音年纪更大一点！？\n虽然感觉有些不可思议……但说不定挺有意思的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1312.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"eb211daaf1b1ba9a4fda8a623e56dfbd696e62b32421dab6206914ae48a1251c","ja":"仲直りできましたか？　このみちゃんにはいちご牛乳を\n貴音ちゃんには熱いお茶を持ってきました。","zh":"你们和好了吗？我给木实拿来了草莓牛奶，\n给贵音拿来了热茶。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1312.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"70849e030184067fde340019a761ef8a9e31cbc3e5dadad0043c573c0454df74","ja":"今はキャラメルラテな気分だけど、\nこれでもOKかな。ありがとう、瑞希お姉ちゃん♪","zh":"虽然现在很想喝焦糖拿铁，\n不过这个也可以啦。谢谢你，瑞希姐姐♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1312.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"504fbdf1f972e621f779487b3dbc4451aa58d42d4b6d36ed75784165cd0570a4","ja":"もちろんです、瑞希お姉様。\nお飲み物、ありがとうございます。","zh":"当然可以，瑞希姐姐大人。\n谢谢您的饮料。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1312.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"83eeffd36a0d7301992c856fa15c92916e1813db986a324d8d5377fe04f6d487","ja":"ふぅ、本当に姉とは大変なのですね……\nかわいい妹たちに、ついつい振り回されてしまいます。","zh":"呼，做姐姐还真是不容易呢……\n不知不觉就被可爱的妹妹们耍得团团转了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1312.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"8412176be84b4ad6aabf3eed1067e59725696e7ff8298c0c1a81eff00df3d4f8","ja":"いいなー……わたしも瑞希さんの妹になりたい！","zh":"真好啊……我也想做瑞希的妹妹！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1312.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"195f8b3dd03a293710738402bfcd89c0c6776585ea40a2cbee911c53a9e60ec0","ja":"じゃあ桃子も、瑞希さんのお姉ちゃん体験に\n協力してあげる！　いいよね、瑞希お姉ちゃん！","zh":"那桃子也来配合瑞希\n体验当姐姐吧！对吧，瑞希姐姐！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1312.unity3d","item_key":"commands[53].text","source_sha256":"2f1c8998156bb873910bc6355491c5c73f361aef7cdf325cb72b075c05cfea06","ja":"私の妹が4人に……。これは、\nお姉さんのやりがいがあるぞ……頑張れ、瑞希。","zh":"我的妹妹变成4个人了……这下，\n当姐姐可太有干劲了……加油，瑞希。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
